sequenceDiagram
  participant Coordinator as SmartRuleEventCoordinator
  participant Room as Cloud outbox DAO
  participant Reconciler
  participant Worker as WorkManager recovery
  participant Firebase as Realtime Database
  Coordinator->>Room: insert execution and gated outbox atomically
  Coordinator->>Room: finalize payload and set ready true atomically
  Worker->>Reconciler: reconcile incomplete events before drain
  Reconciler->>Room: mark ambiguous action OUTCOME_UNKNOWN
  Worker->>Room: read FIFO head only when ready
  Worker->>Firebase: put ruleEvents by stable eventId
  alt acknowledged
    Firebase-->>Worker: success
    Worker->>Room: set execution SYNCED and remove head
  else offline or rejected
    Firebase-->>Worker: error
    Worker->>Room: keep pending or mark permanent failure
  end
